op:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%93%E7%8F%80%E8%8A%B1%E7%8E%AF\" title=\"库珀花环\"><img alt=\"库珀花环\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BA%93%E7%8F%80%E8%8A%B1%E7%8E%AF\" title=\"库珀花环\">库珀花环</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>黑白64方格</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：311703</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3117/311703/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一本演出记录，来源于马戏团成员<br /><br />“她之前从未在城堡上进行演出，那儿的情况比我们设想的要坏上许多……长年的风吹日晒让砖石发脆，砖缝里长满了土黄色的草根，这些草根甚至起到了粘合剂的作用——让这座城堡不至于立刻坍塌。”<br />……<br />“当我把这些情况告诉了她——我们的空中飞人演员之后，她反而打定了演出的主意。我问她为什么，她没有回答，只是看向那座城堡的城垛，那儿正飘着小小的旗帜。”<br />……<br />“城堡无言地耸立着，几乎要与天空融为一体。我沿着她的目光看去，发现城堡的顶端比平时演出的高度更高，几乎像一把劈开天空的利剑——她是正在为此着迷吗？”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"311703\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8a/Belonging-311704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“崭新黎明”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\"> \"A New Dawn\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3.1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者亲手制作的饰品，出于缝补衣物的习惯，她留下了这块边角料，并最终缝制成了这个装饰品。<br />它是往日那座堡垒中不多的残存，而如今，她已成为一座新堡垒的筑造者。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/33/Belonging-311705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">久远之物<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Palette of the Past</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />12.7<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>曾经久埋于地底的色彩，论及价值并不名贵，镶嵌时也仅经过了简单的打磨。<br />受访者面带笑意地分享了一些与其相关的琐事，可以看出，她很善于保管生活中这些微小而闪亮的事物。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e4/Belonging-311706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“方寸的光芒”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Luminous Heart\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />48<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者为自己布置的课后作业，一个将自身神秘术与理线学结合起来的尝试。<br />要确认未来的方向并不容易，因此，一颗想要收集光芒、探明道路的心就尤为可贵，这个尚且粗糙的装置也是如此。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 宇宙之壳1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B31.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 宇宙之壳2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E5%A3%B32.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">宇宙之壳 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Universe in the Rook's Shell</small></span></span>"}}